{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_3344cba4ba8807330dc7a440","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_628fe293634921cb9ab8e651","precondition_digest":"9f14082f8ca9ba3e77613e4c62ca77cff3c65d122f60d56d8ea6c8a1ffab8aa1","project_id":"proj_user_9e58cf742ce8","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_846dbbfb4588e91f","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_5e843b6101ca5414","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_cffe95be1594028b","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_95af78da2c837f18"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心；II期概念验证+剂量探索，KZ-sGC501三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗12周","quote_sha256":"afa50e21996bea5b6144e7f0e8ee5585a8d11fbecce188e4fbe515e5f8ebad2d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"按1:1:1:1随机分配","quote_sha256":"72c25373ccda39d122959ebb009159ca899766d2229de691c823ffd82e374382","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es2"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"主要终点：第12周NT-proBNP较基线的百分比变化（双盲期）。评价时间点：基线、第4/8/12周。","quote_sha256":"ed3fdeeb458362e8ec2062ccfdb54dabe86146616d3c09971d19582407bead01","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es3"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"II期探索性设计：每组约60例（共约240例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算，用于概念验证与剂量选择。","quote_sha256":"7411ad614a6bc1e1b1bc03c65dcf06543f1df1ba65f37f430568a8bbbe339e96","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es4"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:revision:6","quote":"18-75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF成人，LVEF≤40%，NYHA II-III级，筛选前已接受稳定GDMT至少4周仍有症状。","quote_sha256":"1bca6e0ea3bae1a17cf190603526bfac78350edd007a44ce7b03e4e6f3f98249","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","span_id":"es5"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es1","es2","es3","es4","es5"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":5},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充项目级剂量调整SOP及合并用药禁限清单","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_summary_1","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整方案","合并用药限制清单"],"target":"方案概要中剂量调整规则与合并用药限制"},{"action":"补充项目级安全性报告流程文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_summary_2","missing_source_classes":["安全性报告SOP","AE/SAE定义与时限"],"target":"方案概要中安全性报告时限与AE分类标准"}],"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为一项随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心II期临床研究，旨在评价SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）在射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）成人患者中的概念验证与剂量探索。研究设KZ-sGC501低剂量（2.5 mg每日一次）、中剂量（5 mg每日一次）、高剂量（10 mg每日一次）三个试验组及安慰剂对照组，按1:1:1:1比例随机分配，双盲双模拟给药，每日晨起随餐口服，治疗期12周，所有受试者联合标准指南指导的药物治疗（GDMT）背景。目标人群为18至75岁慢性稳定性HFrEF成人，左室射血分数（LVEF）≤40%，纽约心脏协会（NYHA）心功能II至III级，筛选前已接受稳定剂量GDMT至少4周仍有心衰症状。主要疗效终点为第12周N末端B型利钠肽前体（NT-proBNP）较基线的百分比变化，评价时间点为基线、第4周、第8周和第12周。安全性评价包括不良事件与严重不良事件发生率、症状性低血压与体位性低血压、生命体征（血压、心率）、肝肾功能及电解质实验室指标和12导联心电图。研究共计划入组约240例受试者（每组约60例），基于NT-proBNP组间差值文献效应量与80%把握度估算。统计分析以全分析集（FAS）为主要分析集，主要终点采用协方差分析（ANCOVA，基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势。研究时期包括筛选期（第-28天至第-1天）、12周双盲治疗期（第0天随机给药至第12周）、治疗结束访视（第12周±3天）及安全随访期（末次给药后2周）。","rationale":"本段正文依据当前项目已确认研究事实中的总体设计、剂量方案、目标人群、主要终点、样本量、统计策略和研究时期编写。医学经理需核实：剂量调整具体规则（每4周评估耐受性后的调整条件与幅度）、合并用药限制（硝酸酯类、PDE5抑制剂等禁限用清单）、安全性事件报告时限与分类标准、双盲范围是否涵盖受试者、研究者及终点评价者。上述实施细节在来源中未给出具体数值或规则，不应在方案概要中预设。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（方案概要）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_846dbbfb4588e91f","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"检索并上传HFrEF流行病学综述、中国心衰诊疗指南及sGC刺激剂类既往II/III期临床文献","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_disease_1","missing_source_classes":["流行病学数据","诊疗指南","既往临床证据"],"target":"疾病背景及治疗现状全章"}],"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["HFrEF流行病学与疾病负担数据","HFrEF诊疗指南或专家共识","HFrEF当前标准治疗现状与未满足需求文献","支持II期立项的既往sGC刺激剂类临床证据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要HFrEF的流行病学数据（患病率、发病率、疾病负担）、当前标准治疗现状（GDMT组成及未满足需求）以及支持本研究立项的指南或文献依据。当前允许来源中无HFrEF流行病学、疾病负担或治疗现状的项目级资料；公司语料来源为PNH、炎症性皮肤病和特应性皮炎方案，属跨适应症，仅可用于章节结构参照，不得迁移疾病特异事实。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_5e843b6101ca5414","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_83e9420f4f9f88b3:full-draft:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_cffe95be1594028b\n章节编号=2.3\n章节标题=研究药物简介\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）","quote_sha256":"a06b35fb12090f72b7091f513d8d5327a5c02b7cdc9270c6244681cc2be80507","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","span_id":"es7"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es7"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传IB或等效药物综述文件","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_1","missing_source_classes":["IB","非临床综述","既往临床数据"],"target":"研究药物简介中作用机制与PK/PD描述"},{"action":"补充已知安全性信号及类效应信息","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_drug_2","missing_source_classes":["安全性风险摘要","类效应文献"],"target":"研究药物简介中安全性风险概述"}],"heading":"研究药物简介","missing_source_classes":["研究药物作用机制详述","药代动力学与药效学数据","非临床毒理学摘要","既往人体研究资料及研究者手册（IB）"],"proposal_text":"SMOKE-r5-1W口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC501）为小分子化合物，以口服固体制剂形式给药，通过全身暴露发挥药理作用。本品拟用于射血分数降低的心力衰竭（HFrEF）成人患者的II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，在标准GDMT背景治疗基础上联合使用。KZ-sGC501的给药方案为每日晨起随餐口服一次，设2.5 mg、5 mg和10 mg三个剂量水平。","rationale":"本段仅写入来源中可确认的药物标识信息：药物名称、小分子技术类型、口服固体制剂、全身暴露、适应症及三个剂量水平。作用机制详述（sGC刺激对cGMP通路的影响）、药代动力学特征（吸收、分布、代谢、消除）、非临床毒理学数据及既往人体研究经验均无项目级来源支持，不得在正文中臆造。医学经理需补充IB或等效非临床/临床综述后方可扩展本章节。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_cffe95be1594028b","section_number":"2.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006033949_db0fbff9","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"上传IB非临床章节或等效非临床研究报告摘要","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_nonclin_1","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学","非临床毒理学","非临床PK","安全药理学","遗传毒性","生殖毒性"],"target":"非临床研究结果全章"}],"heading":"非临床研究结果","missing_source_classes":["非临床药理学研究摘要","非临床毒理学研究摘要（含安全药理学）","非临床药代动力学数据","遗传毒性与生殖毒性研究"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要KZ-sGC501的非临床研究结果，包括体外sGC激活/刺激活性、动物模型中的血流动力学与心功能效应、主要种属的药代动力学、重复给药毒理学（含安全药理学）、遗传毒性和生殖毒性数据。当前允许来源中无任何非临床研究资料，章节当前正文为空。不得以通用sGC刺激剂类效应或竞品数据替代本项目非临床事实。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_9e58cf742ce8_95af78da2c837f18","section_number":"2.3.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:d4d763c50412eaba27f2e461","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_651c3c52586700892904:r6:8a374c3cdfe1fcad","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:04ac0381ef4b49","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:7252de902642cb","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:76a6125fa7dca4","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fc6f8c9ea6d34b"]}],"source_bindin